-- ปรับแต่งสไตล์และสัดส่วน UI ให้คมชัด สวยงาม ไม่เบี้ยว หรือล้นขอบ
local function polishUI()
    if not (Fluent and Fluent.GUI) then return end
    pcall(function()
        for _, d in ipairs(Fluent.GUI:GetDescendants()) do
            if d:IsA("UIScale") and d.Name == "MotionScale" then
                d.Scale = 1
                d:GetPropertyChangedSignal("Scale"):Connect(function()
                    if d.Scale > 1.01 then d.Scale = 1 end
                end)
            elseif d:IsA("ImageLabel") and d.Image == "rbxassetid://8992230677" then
                d.ImageColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 255)
                d:GetPropertyChangedSignal("ImageColor3"):Connect(function()
                    if d.ImageColor3 ~= Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 255) then
                        d.ImageColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 255)
                    end
                end)
            end
        end
        if Fluent.Window and Fluent.Window.Root then
            local mainFrame = Fluent.Window.Root:FindFirstChild("Main") or Fluent.Window.Root:FindFirstChildOfClass("Frame")
            if mainFrame then
                mainFrame.BackgroundTransparency = 0
                mainFrame.BackgroundColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(22, 22, 26)
            end
        end
    end)
end

if Fluent.GUI then
    Fluent.GUI.DescendantAdded:Connect(function(d)
        if d:IsA("UIScale") and d.Name == "MotionScale" then
            task.defer(function()
                d.Scale = 1
                d:GetPropertyChangedSignal("Scale"):Connect(function()
                    if d.Scale > 1.01 then d.Scale = 1 end
                end)
            end)
        elseif d:IsA("ImageLabel") and d.Image == "rbxassetid://8992230677" then
            task.defer(function()
                d.ImageColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 255)
                d:GetPropertyChangedSignal("ImageColor3"):Connect(function()
                    if d.ImageColor3 ~= Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 255) then
                        d.ImageColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 255)
                    end
                end)
            end)
        end
    end)
end
polishUI()

local Options = Fluent.Options

local ConfigState = {
    -- Main Fishing
    AutoFish = false,
    AlwaysPerfect = true,
    AutoSecretCast = true,
    AutoStorePenFull = true,
    AutoClaimRewards = true,
    AutoBuyRods = true,
    AutoBuyBar = true,
    AutoEquipBestBeasts = false,
    AutoEquipBestEggs = false,
    AntiAfk = true,
    AutoSellByRate = true,
    SellThreshold = 500,
    SellThresholdText = "500",
    CleanStorageEvery = 20,
    TotalCatches = 0,
    TotalSold = 0,

    -- Training Cycle
    AutoTrain = false,
    TrainForSeconds = 60,
    ThrowForSeconds = 60,
    AutoHitDoubleRep = true,
    AutoUpgradeBar = true,
    CycleState = "Idle",
    CycleTimeLeft = 0,
    TotalDoubleHits = 0,
    LastCatchText = "None"
}

local function saveAccountConfig()
    if isScriptInitializing or isRestoringConfig then return end
    if typeof(writefile) ~= "function" then return end

    ensureConfigFolders()

    local data = {
        AlwaysPerfect = ConfigState.AlwaysPerfect,
        AutoSecretCast = ConfigState.AutoSecretCast,
        AutoStorePenFull = ConfigState.AutoStorePenFull,
        AutoClaimRewards = ConfigState.AutoClaimRewards,
        AutoBuyRods = ConfigState.AutoBuyRods,
        AutoBuyBar = ConfigState.AutoBuyBar,
        AntiAfk = ConfigState.AntiAfk,
        AutoEquipBestBeasts = ConfigState.AutoEquipBestBeasts,
        AutoEquipBestEggs = ConfigState.AutoEquipBestEggs,
        AutoFish = ConfigState.AutoFish,
        AutoSellByRate = ConfigState.AutoSellByRate,
        SellThreshold = ConfigState.SellThreshold,
        SellThresholdText = ConfigState.SellThresholdText or tostring(ConfigState.SellThreshold),
        AutoTrain = ConfigState.AutoTrain,
        TrainForSeconds = ConfigState.TrainForSeconds,
        ThrowForSeconds = ConfigState.ThrowForSeconds,
        AutoHitDoubleRep = ConfigState.AutoHitDoubleRep,
        AutoUpgradeBar = ConfigState.AutoBuyBar
    }

    pcall(function()
        local json = HttpService:JSONEncode(data)
        writefile(accountConfigFile, json)
    end)
end

local function loadAccountConfig()
    if typeof(readfile) ~= "function" or typeof(isfile) ~= "function" then return end
    ensureConfigFolders()

    local exists = false
    pcall(function()
        exists = isfile(accountConfigFile)
    end)
    if not exists then return end

    local raw = nil
    pcall(function()
        raw = readfile(accountConfigFile)
    end)
    if not raw or raw == "" then return end

    local data = nil
    pcall(function()
        data = HttpService:JSONDecode(raw)
    end)
    if typeof(data) ~= "table" then return end

    isRestoringConfig = true

    pcall(function()
        if data.AlwaysPerfect ~= nil and Options.AlwaysPerfect then
            Options.AlwaysPerfect:SetValue(data.AlwaysPerfect)
        end
        if data.AutoSecretCast ~= nil and Options.AutoSecretCast then
            Options.AutoSecretCast:SetValue(data.AutoSecretCast)
        end
        if data.AutoStorePenFull ~= nil and Options.AutoStorePenFull then
            Options.AutoStorePenFull:SetValue(data.AutoStorePenFull)
        end
        if data.AutoClaimRewards ~= nil and Options.AutoClaimRewards then
            Options.AutoClaimRewards:SetValue(data.AutoClaimRewards)
        end
        if data.AntiAfk ~= nil and Options.AntiAfk then
            Options.AntiAfk:SetValue(data.AntiAfk)
        end
        if data.AutoEquipBestBeasts ~= nil and Options.AutoEquipBestBeasts then
            Options.AutoEquipBestBeasts:SetValue(data.AutoEquipBestBeasts)
        end
        if data.AutoEquipBestEggs ~= nil and Options.AutoEquipBestEggs then
            Options.AutoEquipBestEggs:SetValue(data.AutoEquipBestEggs)
        end
        if data.AutoFish ~= nil and Options.AutoFish then
            Options.AutoFish:SetValue(data.AutoFish)
        end
        if data.AutoSellByRate ~= nil and Options.AutoSellByRate then
            Options.AutoSellByRate:SetValue(data.AutoSellByRate)
        end
        local savedThreshStr = data.SellThresholdText or (data.SellThreshold and tostring(data.SellThreshold))
        if savedThreshStr and Options.SellThreshold then
            Options.SellThreshold:SetValue(tostring(savedThreshStr))
        end
        if data.AutoTrain ~= nil and Options.AutoTrain then
            Options.AutoTrain:SetValue(data.AutoTrain)
        end
        if data.TrainForSeconds ~= nil and Options.TrainFor then
            Options.TrainFor:SetValue(tonumber(data.TrainForSeconds) or 60)
        end
        if data.ThrowForSeconds ~= nil and Options.ThrowFor then
            Options.ThrowFor:SetValue(tonumber(data.ThrowForSeconds) or 60)
        end
        if data.AutoHitDoubleRep ~= nil and Options.AutoHitDoubleRep then
            Options.AutoHitDoubleRep:SetValue(data.AutoHitDoubleRep)
        end
        if data.AutoBuyRods ~= nil and Options.AutoBuyRods then
            Options.AutoBuyRods:SetValue(data.AutoBuyRods)
        end
        local barVal = data.AutoBuyBar
        if barVal == nil then barVal = data.AutoUpgradeBar end
        if barVal ~= nil then
            if Options.AutoBuyBar then
                Options.AutoBuyBar:SetValue(barVal)
            end
            if Options.AutoUpgradeBar then
                Options.AutoUpgradeBar:SetValue(barVal)
            end
        end
    end)

    isRestoringConfig = false
end

local function applyPerfectBait(enabled)
    if Config.BaitById then
        for _, bait in pairs(Config.BaitById) do
            bait.PerfectCast = enabled
        end
    end
end
applyPerfectBait(true)

if not getgenv()._NetCastHooked then
    getgenv()._NetCastHooked = true
    local oldInvoke = Net.invoke
    Net.invoke = function(name, ...)
        local args = { ... }
        if name == "Cast" and ConfigState.AlwaysPerfect then
            args[1] = 1
        end
        return oldInvoke(name, unpack(args))
    end
end

local function triggerAntiAfk()
    pcall(function()
        if VirtualUser then
            VirtualUser:CaptureController()
            VirtualUser:ClickButton2(Vector2.new(50, 50))
        end
    end)
    pcall(function()
        if VirtualUser then
            VirtualUser:Button2Down(Vector2.new(50, 50))
            task.wait(0.04)
            VirtualUser:Button2Up(Vector2.new(50, 50))
        end
    end)
end

getgenv()._AntiAfkConn = LocalPlayer.Idled:Connect(function()
    if ConfigState.AntiAfk then
        triggerAntiAfk()
    end
end)

local function teleportToLedge()
    pcall(function()
        local char = LocalPlayer.Character or LocalPlayer.CharacterAdded:Wait()
        local hrp = char and (char:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart") or char:WaitForChild("HumanoidRootPart", 3))
        if hrp then
            hrp.CFrame = CFrame.new(-120, 85.5, 40)
        end
    end)
end

local function ensurePosition()
    pcall(function()
        local char = LocalPlayer.Character
        local hrp = char and char:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")
        if hrp then
            local currentPos = hrp.Position
            local inZone = currentPos.X >= (Config.CastLineX or -130) and currentPos.X <= ((Config.LedgeX or -110) - 0.3)
                          and currentPos.Z >= (Config.CastZ0 or 0) and currentPos.Z <= (Config.CastZ1 or 100)

            if not inZone then
                teleportToLedge()
                task.wait(0.3)
            end
        end
    end)
end

-- ฟังก์ชันปิดหน้าต่างและสถานะการเหวี่ยงเบ็ด/ตกปลาทั้งหมด
local function stopCasting()
    pcall(function()
        Net.fire("CastEnd")
    end)
    local char = LocalPlayer.Character
    if char then
        char:SetAttribute("Casting", false)
    end
    local pg = LocalPlayer:FindFirstChild("PlayerGui")
    if pg then
        local castGui = pg:FindFirstChild("CastGui")
        if castGui then
            pcall(function()
                if castGui:FindFirstChild("Aim") then castGui.Aim.Visible = false end
                if castGui:FindFirstChild("Power") then castGui.Power.Visible = false end
                if castGui:FindFirstChild("Slots") then castGui.Slots.Visible = false end
                if castGui:FindFirstChild("LuckButton") then castGui.LuckButton.Visible = false end
                castGui.Enabled = false
            end)
        end
        local over = pg:FindFirstChild("CastScreenOver")
        if over then over.Enabled = false end
        local under = pg:FindFirstChild("CastScreenUnder")
        if under then under.Enabled = false end
    end
end

-- ค้นหาตำแหน่ง Pull-Up Bar ประจำ Plot ของผู้เล่น
local function getGymBar()
    local plotIndex = LocalPlayer:GetAttribute("PlotIndex")
    local gym = workspace.Map:FindFirstChild("Gym")
    if gym and plotIndex then
        return gym:FindFirstChild("PullUpBar_" .. tostring(plotIndex))
    end
    return nil
end

local function teleportToGymBar()
    local bar = getGymBar()
    if bar then
        local pivot = bar:GetPivot()
        local char = LocalPlayer.Character or LocalPlayer.CharacterAdded:Wait()
        local hrp = char:WaitForChild("HumanoidRootPart")
        hrp.CFrame = CFrame.new(pivot.Position.X, pivot.Position.Y + 3, pivot.Position.Z)
        return true
    end
    return false
end

local function startTraining()
    stopCasting()
    task.wait(0.2)
    local char = LocalPlayer.Character
    if not (char and char:GetAttribute("Training")) then
        teleportToGymBar()
        task.wait(0.3)
        Net.fire("StartTraining")
    end
end

local function stopTraining()
    local char = LocalPlayer.Character
    if char and char:GetAttribute("Training") then
        Net.fire("StopTraining")
    end
end

local function tryUpgradeBar()
    local upgradedAny = false
    pcall(function()
        local barTiers = Config.BarTiers or {}
        for _ = 1, 5 do
            local currentTier = LocalPlayer:GetAttribute("BarTier") or 0
            local nextTier = barTiers[currentTier + 1]
            if not nextTier then break end
            local cash = LocalPlayer:GetAttribute("Cash") or 0
            if cash >= (nextTier.Price or 0) then
                local ok = Net.invoke("BuyTier", "Bar")
                if ok then
                    upgradedAny = true
                    task.wait(0.08)
                else
                    break
                end
            else
                break
            end
        end
    end)
    return upgradedAny
end
local tryBuyBar = tryUpgradeBar

local function tryBuyRod()
    local boughtAny = false
    pcall(function()
        local rods = Config.Rods or {}
        for _ = 1, 5 do
            local currentRod = LocalPlayer:GetAttribute("Rod") or "Wooden"
            local currentIndex = 1
            for i, r in ipairs(rods) do
                if r.Id == currentRod then
                    currentIndex = i
                    break
                end
            end
            local nextRod = rods[currentIndex + 1]
            if not nextRod then break end
            local cash = LocalPlayer:GetAttribute("Cash") or 0
            if cash >= (nextRod.Price or 0) then
                local ok = Net.invoke("Buy", "Rod", nextRod.Id)
                if ok then
                    boughtAny = true
                    task.wait(0.08)
                else
                    break
                end
            else
                break
            end
        end
    end)
    return boughtAny
end

local function claimAllRewards()
    local claimed = 0
    for i = 1, 12 do
        local ok = pcall(function()
            return Net.invoke("Claim", "Gift", i)
        end)
        if ok then
            claimed = claimed + 1
            task.wait(0.05)
        end
    end
    pcall(function()
        Net.invoke("Claim", "Daily")
    end)
    pcall(function()
        Net.invoke("Claim", "Favorite")
    end)
    return claimed
end

local function equipBestBeasts()
    pcall(function()
        Net.fire("FillPen")
    end)
end

local function equipBestEggs()
    local ok, res = pcall(function()
        return Net.invoke("PetEquip", "Best")
    end)
    return ok, res
end

local function cleanStorageByValue(threshold)
    local count = 0
    pcall(function()
        local state = Net.State
        if not (state and state.Beasts) then return end

        local toSell = {}
        for _, b in pairs(state.Beasts) do
            if b.S == "store" and not b.L and (b.V or 0) <= threshold then
                table.insert(toSell, b.Id)
            end
        end

        if #toSell == 0 then return end

        local char = LocalPlayer.Character
        local hrp = char and (char:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart") or char:WaitForChild("HumanoidRootPart", 3))
        if not hrp then return end

        local prevCF = hrp.CFrame
        hrp.CFrame = CFrame.new(-140, 89.5, -26.7)
        task.wait(0.25)

        for _, id in ipairs(toSell) do
            local ok = Net.invoke("SellBeast", id)
            if ok then
                count = count + 1
                task.wait(0.03)
            end
        end

        hrp.CFrame = prevCF
    end)
    return count
end

